    "updated_at": "2022-07-15T09:12:39Z",
    "body": "Actually, it can even be the same window/tab. The original example Apple talked about was being on `somebank.com/page` and hitting logout. So `somebank.com/page` is in the cache now but the cookies have been deleted by the headers returned by the logout URL. With this proposal it would be evicted due to the cookie change. Other tabs/windows are also a problem.",
