    "created_at": "2025-05-20T08:32:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-20T10:00:15Z",
    "body": "Abysmal abuse of the spec, presumably to boost page-load time to make chromium look more attractive to firefox/safari.\n\nLike @Maxim-Mazurok suggested, this change should at least have come with an additional opt-out `Cache-Control` header value for those of us who rely on `no-store` busting bfcache!",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
