    "created_at": "2025-05-23T18:10:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-23T18:10:24Z",
    "body": "One way to describe this proposal in light of [#5744](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5744) is to say that setting a cookie should implicitly invoke \"history.clear()\".\n\nTwo limitations to this proposal are:\n* There are APIs other than cookies that log in or out\n* history.clear() addresses concerns that go beyond the back/forward cache\n\nSo, all things being equal, I tend to prefer the history.clear() proposal. If we want to add to that a proposal for an HTTP header than can have the same effect, so much the better.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
